```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant MP as Mercado Pago
    participant KAFKA as Kafka (payment-processed)
    participant CONSUMER as PaymentProcessedConsumer
    participant CLAIM as ReservaVacanteNotificacionClaimFeignAdapter
    participant CORE as tesoreria-core-service
    participant SVC as ReservaVacanteService
    participant NOTIF as ReservaVacanteNotificationFeignAdapter
    participant N8N as n8n Webhook
    participant DLT as Kafka (payment-processed.DLT)

    MP->>KAFKA: Publica PaymentProcessedEvent
    KAFKA->>CONSUMER: Consume evento
    alt Evento descartado
        CONSUMER->>CONSUMER: reservaVacanteId nulo o status distinto de approved
    else Pago aprobado de reserva de vacante
        CONSUMER->>CLAIM: claim(reservaVacanteId)
        CLAIM->>CORE: POST /api/tesoreria/core/umhub/reservaVacante/{id}/notificacion/claim
        CORE-->>CLAIM: true si esta entrega gana el claim
        alt Otra entrega ya notificó
            CLAIM-->>CONSUMER: false
            CONSUMER->>CONSUMER: No-op
        else Claim ganado
            CLAIM-->>CONSUMER: true
            CONSUMER->>SVC: getStatus(reservaVacanteId)
            SVC-->>CONSUMER: ReservaVacante
            CONSUMER->>CONSUMER: setStatus("pagado")
            alt Envío correcto
                CONSUMER->>NOTIF: notifyPayment(reservaVacante, event)
                NOTIF->>N8N: POST /webhook/mercado-pago
                N8N-->>NOTIF: 200 OK
                NOTIF-->>CONSUMER: Notificación enviada
            else Reserva inexistente o fallo del POST a n8n
                CONSUMER->>CLAIM: release(reservaVacanteId)
                CLAIM->>CORE: POST /api/tesoreria/core/umhub/reservaVacante/{id}/notificacion/release
                CONSUMER-->>KAFKA: Excepción propagada
                KAFKA->>CONSUMER: Reintento con backoff exponencial (1 s x 2, hasta 5 intentos)
                KAFKA->>DLT: Reintentos agotados o JSON inválido
            end
        end
    end
```
